01:14:59.533 --> 01:15:03.738
Bagus, hampir selesai.

01:15:38.873 --> 01:15:41.909
Oke, selesai?

01:15:42.009 --> 01:15:44.845
Ya, selesai. Bagus.

01:15:45.980 --> 01:15:48.849
Sekarang taruh di freezer.

01:15:48.949 --> 01:15:51.552
Oke.

01:15:51.652 --> 01:15:55.322
Bagus.

01:15:58.159 --> 01:16:00.461
Sekarang kamu bisa pergi.

01:16:00.561 --> 01:16:02.930
Beneran?

01:16:03.030 --> 01:16:06.067
Ya, beneran. Tapi ingat,

01:16:06.167 --> 01:16:08.436
kalau kamu ngomong ke siapa-siapa,

01:16:08.537 --> 01:16:11.506
aku bakal cari kamu.

01:16:11.605 --> 01:16:13.474
Paham?

01:16:13.574 --> 01:16:14.942
-Paham.

01:16:15.042 --> 01:16:17.378
Bagus.

01:16:17.478 --> 01:16:20.181
Pergi.

01:16:20.281 --> 01:16:22.083
Oke, makasih.

01:16:22.650 --> 01:16:25.586
Jangan makasih ke aku.

01:16:25.686 --> 01:16:28.589
Pergi aja.

01:16:29.723 --> 01:16:31.759
Oke.

01:17:24.378 --> 01:17:25.980
Oke, aku pergi.

01:17:26.080 --> 01:17:27.681
Russell, kamu nggak apa-apa?

01:17:36.190 --> 01:17:39.093
Ya, aku nggak apa-apa.

01:17:44.365 --> 01:17:45.966
Apa yang terjadi?

01:17:52.773 --> 01:17:55.209
Nggak ada. Aku cuma... mereka suruh aku...

01:17:56.177 --> 01:17:58.145
Suruh kamu apa?

01:17:59.213 --> 01:18:00.681
Nggak ada. Lupakan.

01:18:00.781 --> 01:18:05.620
Kamu yakin nggak apa-apa?

01:18:05.719 --> 01:18:07.021
Ya, aku yakin.

01:18:07.121 --> 01:18:09.757
Oke, ayo pulang.

01:18:09.857 --> 01:18:13.394
Oke.

01:18:14.028 --> 01:18:16.697
Kamu mau cerita nggak?

01:18:16.797 --> 01:18:20.334
Nggak, nggak mau.

01:18:20.768 --> 01:18:24.639
Oke, nggak apa-apa.

01:18:24.738 --> 01:18:28.475
Aku di sini kalau butuh apa-apa ya.

01:18:29.578 --> 01:18:31.712
Makasih.

01:18:32.079 --> 01:18:34.549
Sama-sama.

01:18:34.649 --> 01:18:38.352
Oke, sampai rumah ya.

01:18:39.386 --> 01:18:40.955
Oke.

01:18:41.055 --> 01:18:44.892
Hati-hati ya.

01:18:44.992 --> 01:18:47.696
Kamu juga.

01:18:47.795 --> 01:18:51.498
Dadah.

01:18:51.600 --> 01:18:54.134
Dadah.

01:18:54.235 --> 01:18:57.071
Russell, kamu harus cerita ke polisi.

01:18:57.171 --> 01:19:00.107
Nggak, aku nggak bisa.

01:19:01.308 --> 01:19:02.910
Kenapa nggak?

01:19:03.712 --> 01:19:05.913
Karena mereka bakal bunuh aku.

01:19:06.013 --> 01:19:08.949
Siapa yang bakal bunuh kamu?

01:19:09.049 --> 01:19:11.252
Mereka. Patti dan yang lain.

01:19:11.352 --> 01:19:12.753
Kamu serius?

01:19:14.088 --> 01:19:15.990
Ya, serius.

01:19:16.090 --> 01:19:19.260
Kita harus pergi dari sini.

01:19:23.897 --> 01:19:26.133
Pergi ke mana?

01:19:30.337 --> 01:19:32.172
Jauh dari sini.

01:19:34.408 --> 01:19:36.777
Oke, ayo pergi.

01:19:38.379 --> 01:19:42.651
Sekarang?

01:21:16.678 --> 01:21:18.580
Ya, sekarang.

01:21:19.681 --> 01:21:21.382
Oke, ayo.

01:21:25.720 --> 01:21:28.857
Kamu bawa barang-barangmu?

01:21:31.659 --> 01:21:34.629
Ya, udah.

01:21:42.035 --> 01:21:44.171
Oke, ayo pergi.

01:21:44.572 --> 01:21:46.808
Hati-hati ya.

01:21:46.907 --> 01:21:49.042
Kamu juga.

01:21:49.143 --> 01:21:52.413
Oke, ayo pergi.

01:21:52.814 --> 01:21:55.315
...Aku harus jaga diriku sendiri.

01:21:58.653 --> 01:22:00.020
-Harus dapet bagianmu.

01:22:00.120 --> 01:22:02.524
-A-aku masih ngebebasin kamu,
oke?

01:22:02.624 --> 01:22:04.559
Aku nggak bohong soal itu.

01:22:05.727 --> 01:22:07.294
-Oke.

01:22:07.394 --> 01:22:09.697
-Nggak apa-apa, oke?
Kamu nggak harus --

01:22:09.798 --> 01:22:11.498
-Patti! Ya ampun! Berhenti!

01:22:11.599 --> 01:22:13.668
Apaan sih?! Berhenti!

01:22:13.768 --> 01:22:15.703
Patti, berhenti!

01:22:15.804 --> 01:22:17.839
Patti! Apaan sih?!

01:22:36.758 --> 01:22:37.826
-Halo?

01:22:40.060 --> 01:22:42.831
Ainsley?

01:22:42.931 --> 01:22:45.700
Ainsley?

01:22:47.569 --> 01:22:49.169
Halo?

01:22:56.376 --> 01:22:58.345
Halo?

01:22:58.445 --> 01:22:59.581
-Hei.

01:22:59.681 --> 01:23:01.783
Aku denger kamu.
-Hei. Hei.

01:23:01.883 --> 01:23:04.051
Hei, kamu nggak apa-apa?

01:23:09.990 --> 01:23:12.192
Kamu nggak apa-apa?

01:23:13.928 --> 01:23:15.630
-Nggak.

01:23:15.730 --> 01:23:17.899
Aku di dalam freezer.

01:23:17.998 --> 01:23:19.634
Dingin banget sialan.

01:23:19.734 --> 01:23:20.969
-Oke. Oke.

01:23:21.068 --> 01:23:22.804
Kita bakal lewatin ini
bareng-bareng, oke?

01:23:22.904 --> 01:23:24.271
Cuma -- Cuma terus napas.

01:23:27.609 --> 01:23:29.844
Ada apa...

01:23:30.377 --> 01:23:32.045
Di sekitarmu ada apa?
Kamu lihat apa?

01:23:32.145 --> 01:23:34.448
-Mm, cuma kotak.

01:23:34.549 --> 01:23:36.149
Kotak makanan kosong.

01:23:36.250 --> 01:23:38.018
-Oke, Oke.
Apa lagi?

01:23:38.118 --> 01:23:40.522
-Um... kantong sampah.

01:23:40.622 --> 01:23:43.090
-Oke. Ambil kantong sampahnya.
-Oke.

01:23:43.190 --> 01:23:44.759
Oke.

01:23:44.859 --> 01:23:47.896
-Kamu bakal mulai bungkus
 badanmu pakai kantong sampah itu.

01:23:47.996 --> 01:23:51.198
Kayak... kayak ponco.

01:23:53.433 --> 01:23:56.804
Itu harusnya jaga
 suhu tubuh inti kamu.

01:23:59.574 --> 01:24:01.341
-Oke.
Ya.

01:24:01.441 --> 01:24:03.545
-Gimana?
Ngebantu?

01:24:03.645 --> 01:24:05.947
-Mm, kayaknya iya.

01:24:06.046 --> 01:24:07.615
-Aku di sini.

01:24:08.016 --> 01:24:10.685
Aku di sini.
Terus napas aja.

01:24:11.385 --> 01:24:15.055
Terus napas aja.

01:24:15.155 --> 01:24:17.559
-Terus napas aja.

01:24:24.064 --> 01:24:25.867
-Russell?

01:24:25.967 --> 01:24:27.569
-Ya.

01:24:28.468 --> 01:24:31.305
-Aku bakal pertahanin bayi kita.

01:24:33.608 --> 01:24:34.842
-Apa?

01:24:36.310 --> 01:24:39.279
-Aku nggak bakal biarin Patti
 jual dia.

01:24:41.148 --> 01:24:43.518
-Bayi kita?

01:24:44.151 --> 01:24:45.753
-Ya.

01:24:46.921 --> 01:24:49.189
Dia di ruangan sebelah.

01:24:50.324 --> 01:24:53.160
Aku belum kasih nama dia.

01:24:53.628 --> 01:24:55.730
A--

01:24:56.430 --> 01:25:00.400
Aku pikir... kamu mungkin mau jadi
 bagian dari itu.

01:25:04.572 --> 01:25:07.374
-Kita bakal lewatin ini
 bareng-bareng, oke?

01:25:07.474 --> 01:25:10.277
Cuma... terus napas.

01:25:10.377 --> 01:25:14.114
Terus napas.

01:25:28.462 --> 01:25:30.197
-Ainsley?

01:25:34.068 --> 01:25:36.503
Ainsley, kamu nggak apa-apa?

01:25:39.641 --> 01:25:41.341
Ainsley?

01:25:47.214 --> 01:25:50.518
Ainsley, kamu nggak apa-apa?

01:25:54.822 --> 01:25:57.058
-Nggak.

01:26:56.751 --> 01:26:58.485
-Chief!

01:26:59.620 --> 01:27:01.254
Chief!

01:28:27.508 --> 01:28:29.510
-Yara di mana?

01:28:32.013 --> 01:28:34.414
-Aku tusuk lehernya.

01:28:38.451 --> 01:28:40.621
-Dia mati?

01:28:41.421 --> 01:28:43.958
-Benar.

01:28:54.836 --> 01:28:56.436
-Berhenti!

01:29:09.884 --> 01:29:11.219
Berhenti!

01:29:15.189 --> 01:29:18.059
Mundur.

01:29:21.896 --> 01:29:22.897
Sekarang!

01:29:41.983 --> 01:29:44.619
Aah. Aah.

01:29:58.232 --> 01:30:00.167
Aah!

01:30:06.473 --> 01:30:09.744
Keluar dari sini.
Pergi. Pergi!

01:30:18.552 --> 01:30:21.055
-Itu bayimu.

01:30:23.858 --> 01:30:26.627
Kamu hampir bunuh dia.

01:30:27.395 --> 01:30:29.597
-Aku tahu kamu bakal tangkep.

01:30:32.333 --> 01:30:34.635
-Tunggu.
T-Tunggu.

01:30:35.369 --> 01:30:37.605
Aku punya...

01:30:37.705 --> 01:30:40.608
Aku punya cek kamu.

01:30:40.708 --> 01:30:43.577
Ambil.
Ini -- Ini semua milikmu.

01:30:44.879 --> 01:30:48.049
Nah, tunggu. Tunggu.
Kalau...

01:30:48.416 --> 01:30:50.952
Kalau kamu bunuh aku...

01:30:52.720 --> 01:30:58.092
...b-- bisnisnya
 bakal berhenti, dan... t--

01:30:58.192 --> 01:31:00.594
ceknya bakal nggak berharga.

01:31:01.529 --> 01:31:04.098
Nggak ada yang bakal lihat kecemerlanganmu.

01:31:05.465 --> 01:31:08.235
Kamu nggak pengen mereka lihat itu?

01:31:08.602 --> 01:31:10.938
Itu kenapa aku milih kamu.

01:31:12.206 --> 01:31:15.109
Karena kamu jenis yang spesial.

01:31:17.945 --> 01:31:20.815
-Gen yang lebih baik nggak bikin
 orang yang lebih baik.

01:31:20.915 --> 01:31:26.486
Tapi... aku ngelakuin sesuatu
 yang penting di sini.

01:31:36.864 --> 01:31:41.836
-Empat tahun lalu,
 rata-rata 30% sarang lebah

01:31:41.936 --> 01:31:46.807
di barat Amerika Serikat
 hilang karena tungau tiap musim dingin.

01:31:46.907 --> 01:31:50.478
Hari ini, dengan penerapan
 pengeditan gen,

01:31:50.578 --> 01:31:54.115
kita sekarang lihat
 cuma kehilangan 15% tiap tahun,

01:31:54.215 --> 01:31:58.185
dan angka itu
 terus membaik.

01:31:58.919 --> 01:32:03.190
Bantu lebah-lebah ini ngajarin aku
 banyak pelajaran yang mengubah hidup.

01:32:03.290 --> 01:32:06.727
Aku percaya versi terbaik
 dari masyarakat kita

01:32:06.827 --> 01:32:11.499
bakal berfungsi kayak koloni,
di mana setiap usaha penting

01:32:11.599 --> 01:32:15.469
dan kita semua main peran
 di sesuatu yang lebih besar.

01:32:15.870 --> 01:32:19.273
Terima kasih.

01:32:46.167 --> 01:32:48.035
-Nggak apa-apa.

01:32:48.702 --> 01:32:51.138
Santai aja.

01:32:53.374 --> 01:32:55.676
-Kayaknya aku cuma...

01:32:56.610 --> 01:32:59.146
...butuh ngerasa aman.

01:33:01.082 --> 01:33:04.018
-Dan apa kebutuhan kamu
 dari Russell?

01:33:05.453 --> 01:33:08.557
-Cuma butuh dia jujur.

01:33:08.656 --> 01:33:10.958
-Kamu denger dia?

01:33:11.058 --> 01:33:12.960
-Tentu saja.

01:33:14.795 --> 01:33:17.465
-Dan apa kebutuhan kamu,
Russell?

01:33:17.566 --> 01:33:20.634
-Aku, um...

01:33:21.936 --> 01:33:24.672
Aku lagi coba dapetin kepercayaan dia.

01:33:26.440 --> 01:33:28.142
-Bilang ke dia.

01:33:29.877 --> 01:33:34.348
-Aku butuh kamu percaya sama aku
 kalau aku nggak bakal simpen rahasia.

01:33:34.448 --> 01:33:38.319
-Rahasia apa?
Spesifik.

01:33:38.419 --> 01:33:43.657
-Kayak... selingkuhku di Montreal.

01:33:45.259 --> 01:33:47.027
-Bagus.

01:33:47.128 --> 01:33:48.496
Ya.

01:33:51.198 --> 01:33:53.234
Susuh, aku tahu.

01:33:53.334 --> 01:33:57.204
Setelah semua kerjaan yang udah kita lakuin,
 nggak gampang balik ke sana.

01:33:57.304 --> 01:34:01.275
Tapi penting buat bisa
 ngobrolin hal-hal ini.

01:34:10.718 --> 01:34:14.355
<i>-Hari ini, dengan penerapan</i>
<i>pengeditan gen,</i>

01:34:14.455 --> 01:34:18.425
<i>kita sekarang lihat</i>
<i>cuma kehilangan 15% tiap tahun.</i>

01:34:18.527 --> 01:34:20.995
<i>Dan angka itu...</i>
-Mama!

01:34:22.730 --> 01:34:25.366
Mama, lihat.
<i>-Bantu lebah-lebah ini udah...</i>

01:34:25.466 --> 01:34:26.867
-Dia nggak apa-apa?

01:34:26.967 --> 01:34:29.069
-Ya. Ya. Dia nggak apa-apa.
<i>Aku percaya...</i>

01:34:30.404 --> 01:34:34.341
-Wow!
Hampir selesai?

01:34:35.544 --> 01:34:37.244
Yang itu ke mana?

01:34:39.313 --> 01:34:42.683
Ya ampun.
Kamu pernah lakuin ini sebelumnya?

01:34:45.719 --> 01:34:48.155
Dia cukup pintar, ya?

01:34:48.255 --> 01:34:50.224
-Ya. Dia pasti begitu.

01:34:50.324 --> 01:34:53.694
-Kayak ayahnya, kayaknya.
-Oh, sebenernya, dia diadopsi.

01:34:53.794 --> 01:34:55.162
-Oh. Ya?
-Mm-hmm.

01:34:55.262 --> 01:34:57.865
-Ya. Kita beruntung banget
 sama dia.

01:34:57.965 --> 01:35:00.801
Russell dapet koneksi
 di agen adopsi.

01:35:00.901 --> 01:35:03.971
-Kamu nggak bakal tahu.
Dia mirip banget sama dia.

01:35:04.405 --> 01:35:06.207
Namanya siapa lagi?

01:35:07.241 --> 01:35:08.610
-Ainsley.
